      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِصَ</span></b> , (S, [so in two copies, in one mentioned
by Freytag <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُرِصَ</span>, which is a mistake,] M, Msb,
K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَصَ</span></b> , (Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَصٌ</span>, (M, Msb,)
<i>He</i> (a man, S) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, affected with</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَص</span> [or <i>leprosy</i> (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَصٌ</span> below)]. (S, M, Msb,
K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِشَ</span>.]

